credd-2 -> Record for remote ssh://git@gitlab.example.com/x/y.git: a token for https://gitlab.example.com as me.
credd-2 ->   It becomes credential gitlab.example.com, kind gitlab, sealed under the master password.
credd-2 ->   A binding line naming it goes after the record, and gli built with credd fetches the token from credd.
credd-2 -> credd.add  cred:gitlab.example.com  kind:gitlab  linkto:""  perm:""
credd-2 -> Record for remote ssh://git@gitlab.example.com/x/y.git: a token for https://gitlab.example.com as bot.
